"- Transaher Web Service PDF (with Local Fallback): Downloads the official PDF/ZPL from wsEtiExpSOAP and falls back to the local 24-digit barcode QWeb label if unavailable.\n"
"- Transaher Web Service Only: Exclusively uses wsEtiExpSOAP.\n"
"- Local Standard Transaher Label PDF: Generates the label locally following Section 5 of the manual."
msgstr ""
"- PDF Web Service Transaher (con respaldo local): Descarga el PDF/ZPL oficial desde wsEtiExpSOAP y recurre a la etiqueta QWeb local con código de barras de 24 dígitos si no está disponible.\n"
